  journalLore: The old folk say a stone troll was once a troll who sat too long in the sun. It didn't die; it set. Now it walks the scree, and the mountain walks with it.
  journalAdvice: 'Weak to blunt blows; blades and points skid. Its stomp shakes the ground around it: get out, then back in. It throws stones at range.'
  journalHabitat: Troll country and the deep Misty Woods, from the second tier
